<title>FINLAND: KAUPPAKAARI TAKES OVER SMALL TT OPERATION.</title>
<headline>KAUPPAKAARI TAKES OVER SMALL TT OPERATION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish niche publisher Kauppakaari said on Thursday it had taken over a publishing operation from TT-Kustannustieto for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it had acquired a book inventory, publishing rights and an address register for the publications but no personnel would be transferred to Kauppakaari.</p>
<p>&quot;The net sales of these operations have been 1.6 million markka,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>TT-Kustannustieto is owned by the Confederation of Industry and Employers (TT).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
